# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Containers, WSL2, and CI are Linux; CRLF leaking in breaks shell scripts
# and produces noisy diffs. Editors on Windows handle LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types git must never touch. Audio formats are all listed even
# though .gitignore excludes them, because the ignore rule documents a
# `!` exception path: a deliberately committed clip must not meet
# `text=auto eol=lf` on the way in.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.onnx binary
*.ckpt binary
*.safetensors binary
